       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DUAL-QUAT-RIGGING.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DUAL-QUAT-RIGGING-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FIXED-POINT-REJECT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DQS-VOLUME-PRESERVE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LAPLACE-DIFFUSION-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DQS-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DUAL-QUAT-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DUAL-QUAT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DQS-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DQS-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-REJECT-AND-VOLUME.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DIFFUSE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-DQS-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-REJECT-AND-VOLUME.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FIXED-POINT-REJECT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DQS-VOLUME-PRESERVE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DIFFUSE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LAPLACE-DIFFUSION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DQS-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-DQS-PROOFS.
           IF WS-FIXED-POINT-REJECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DQS-VOLUME-PRESERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LAPLACE-DIFFUSION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DQS-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DUAL-QUAT-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DQS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DQS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DQS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DQS-CODE.
